яет в ужас строителей метрополитена?!","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"1020976","ru":"First Date","en":"First Date","year":"2022","type":"Фильм","rating":3.7,"votes":3,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/lkzHzj1aUBUh3xoUrdS1FY5VaPj.jpg","genres":["драма"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"576723","ru":"Дни кита","en":"Los días de la ballena","year":"2019","type":"Фильм","rating":3.7,"votes":3,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/xIbEpKJXD1VyjDCTtOqIejvNwd7.jpg","genres":["драма"],"overview":"Кристина и Симон — художники, которые рисуют граффити на стенах своего родного города Медельина. Однажды они бросают вызов местной преступной банде, нарисовав поверх написанной теми угрозы большого кита. Молодым людям предстоит столкнуться лицом к лицу со страхом, жестокостью и трудностями взросления.","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"1258001","ru":"The Roast of John Cleese","en":"The Roast of John Cleese","year":"2024","type":"Фильм","rating":3.7,"votes":3,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/wS08l1qQ53NqKlyfLFXFnPLQ1wF.jpg","genres":["комедия"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"701688","ru":"Switzerlanders","en":"Switzerlanders","year":"2020","type":"Фильм","rating":3.7,"votes":3,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/zbpecLBMES1YU43hQmGjeLYZ9KG.jpg","genres":["документальный"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes":"","status":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"788947","ru":"Svar við bréfi Helgu","en":"Svar við bréfi Helgu","year":"2022","type":"Фильм","rating":3.7,"votes":3,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/94ZzenT32OUVR7TN4Pt8KADqMBS.jpg","genres":["драма","мелодрама"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","tmdbId":"","episodes"